{"id":"8375f92593690509","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-finite-intersection-closed-class.md","title":"ZFC Finite Intersection Closed Class","display":"df-zfc-finite-intersection-closed-class — ZFC Finite Intersection Closed Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-finite-intersection-closed-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-finite-intersection-closed-class"],"display":"df-zfc-finite-intersection-closed-class — ZFC Finite Intersection Closed Class","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-class]]","[[58-df-closed]]","[[58-df-finite]]","[[58-df-intersection]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-finite-intersection-closed-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-finite-intersection-closed-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-finite-intersection-closed-class — ZFC Finite Intersection Closed Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bef75a54dc1e374b\" href=\"?note=bef75a54dc1e374b\" title=\"58-df-closed\">58-df-closed</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fde8356a8733e94f\" href=\"?note=fde8356a8733e94f\" title=\"58-df-intersection\">58-df-intersection</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> is a definable-class parameter and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in V\">\\(F\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteIntersectionClosedClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteIntersectionClosedClass}_S\\)</span> (unary class predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}finite\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FiniteIntersectionClosedClass}_S(C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\n\\forall F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land F\\neq\\varnothing\\land F\\subseteq C\n\\to\\bigcap F\\in C\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}finite\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FiniteIntersectionClosedClass}_S(C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\n\\forall F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land F\\neq\\varnothing\\land F\\subseteq C\n\\to\\bigcap F\\in C\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Finite subfamilies are quantified as sets <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in V\">\\(F\\in V\\)</span>; no power-set construction is applied to a possible proper class.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-closed","status":"resolved","id":"bef75a54dc1e374b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-closed]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-intersection","status":"resolved","id":"fde8356a8733e94f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-intersection]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Class}_S$ (see [[58-df-class]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}$ (see [[58-df-finite]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteIntersectionClosedClass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}finite\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FiniteIntersectionClosedClass}_S(C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\n\\forall F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land F\\neq\\varnothing\\land F\\subseteq C\n\\to\\bigcap F\\in C\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"F\\in V","display":false}],"bytes":1127,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1934","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-finite-intersection-closed-class.md|58-df-zfc-finite-intersection-closed-class]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ca2a9c9166fa8cce","bef75a54dc1e374b","d9a25b0ac94a3598","fde8356a8733e94f"]}